<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93015" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σᾰγή</span></b> , ἡ, a man's
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pack, baggage</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτόφορτος οἰκεία σαγῇ</span>,
			i.e. carrying his own baggage, etc., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				675
			</span></i>; <i>scrip, wallet, knapsack</i>, Ion Trag.<i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>: then, generally, <i>harness, furniture, equipment</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παντελῆ σαγὴν ἔχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					560
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				207
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοξήρης ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HF</u>
				188
			</span></i>; esp. <i>armour, harness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1092
			</span></i> (prob.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				848
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				1061
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ma.</u>
				3.25
			</span></i>; also in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φεράσπιδες σαγαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					240
				</span></i>
			 (troch.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Th.</u>
				125
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				391
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later,= 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάγμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			, <i>pack-saddle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PGoodsp.Cair.
				30 xxxviii 16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				7.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.185
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.54
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμήλου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					1.19.10
				</span></i>
			; also the <i>padding</i> of a saddle, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.1.20
			</span></i>. (From <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάττω</span>: hence
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανσαγία</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πασσαγία</span>.—On the accent,
				v. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.309
			</span></i>.)</div>
